+++ b/patches/chromium/disable_hidden.patch
@@ -5,6 +5,15 @@ Subject: disable_hidden.patch
 
 Electron uses this to disable background throttling for hidden windows.
 
+Electron also keeps the widget visible while its native view is hidden
+(paintWhenInitiallyHidden, backgroundThrottling: false), so
+RenderWidgetHostViewAura::DidNavigate must not treat such a widget as
+dormant: invalidating the LocalSurfaceId there means the next
+VisualProperties update (e.g. a Window Controls Overlay rect pushed from
+DidFinishNavigation) reaches the renderer without a surface id, which
+makes it defer main frames until the view is eventually shown. Key the
+decision off the host's visibility, as RenderWidgetHostViewMac does.
+
